// A `+++` fence carries a raw body, the same treatment as a codeblock --
// byte-safe against an embedded "]" and newline-preserving (no inline
// markup, no lazy-continuation folding). It replaced `(content:raw)[...]`,
// which could not survive a bracket in its own body.
@quote+++
  don't forget: check [this] and [that]
+++

@quote[ 引用文 ]

